1️⃣5️⃣ PDU Sequence — VERY IMPORTANT

Memorize:

Application   → Data
Transport     → Segment
Network       → Packet
Data Link     → Frame
Physical      → Bits

🧠 Shortcut:

> Data → Segment → Packet → Frame → Bits




