1️⃣7️⃣ Router vs Switch

Switch

Primarily operates at:

Layer 2

Uses:

MAC addresses

Forwards:

Frames


---

Router

Primarily operates at:

Layer 3

Uses:

IP addresses

Forwards:

Packets


---

🔥 1️⃣8️⃣ Hub vs Switch

Hub

Layer 1

Broadcasts incoming bits to connected ports

No MAC learning

No frame-level forwarding intelligence


Switch

Layer 2

Learns MAC addresses

Forwards frames selectively


Therefore:

> Switch is much more intelligent than a traditional hub.




