---

⚠️ 20️⃣ Common GATE Traps

Trap 1

TCP does not operate at the Network Layer.

✅ TCP → Transport


---

Trap 2

IP does not provide reliable end-to-end delivery.

✅ IP → Network layer, best-effort packet delivery.


---

Trap 3

MAC address ≠ IP address.

MAC → Data Link
IP  → Network


---

Trap 4

Switch ≠ Router.

Switch → MAC → Layer 2
Router → IP → Layer 3


---

Trap 5

Transmission of bits occurs at the:

✅ Physical Layer


